    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(My family life)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "I think our family is very happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We all take responsibility for our role in the family."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We always help each other. Every year once or twice we travel together."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My husband works very hard to provide for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My children study hard and I always take care of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I study everyday to prepare for my future."
